WIENER compute_stats IN C's SHAPE: the one kernel that was 127x C PER CALL
and 31-55 % of the port's preset-6 instruction count is now 1.35x C per
call, byte-identical on both ISAs, and the p6 port/C ratio on every 512x512
cell falls from 3.4-5.1x to 2.3-2.8x.

