  compute_stats, 6 calls per 512x512 frame, inclusive Ir:
    before  746,546,988   (124.4 M per call)   127.1x C
    after     7,925,038   (  1.32 M per call)    1.349x C
    C         5,873,732   (  0.98 M per call)
