    gradient  p2  11.77 G / 4.42 G  2.660x -> 11.03 G  2.493x
    gradient  p6   1.61 G / 0.31 G  5.120x ->  0.87 G  2.766x
    photo_cid p2  49.17 G / 27.25 G 1.805x -> 48.43 G  1.777x
