=================== WHAT IS AND IS NOT ESTABLISHED ===================

ESTABLISHED: the kernel's Ir both sides on both cells at p2 and p6; byte
identity of every measured cell and of the C-parity tier sweep on both
ISAs; the aarch64 kernel-bench ratios.
NOT ESTABLISHED: the remaining 1.35x's composition (callgrind attributes
the whole arm as self cost; the asm of the hot loops is clean — 3
instructions per madd, no spills, no per-chunk checks — so it is loop
control, per-row view setup, the drains and `cs_prepare`); the 10-bit
`compute_stats_hbd` path (untouched, still scalar); anything about the
LR search's other 44 M at p6.
